</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p>
</p><p style="margin-top:4px;text-indent:37px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">遵照市委、市教育局党委相关要求，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">2月25</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">日下午，绍兴一中党委举行班子民主生活会。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px">市</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px">纪委监委驻市教育局纪检监察组组长商迪美</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px">出席会议并讲话，市纪委监委驻市教育局纪检监察组二级主任科员</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px">周小晔</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px">出席会议。</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">会议由</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">市教育局副局长、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">校党委书记</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">丁初效</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">主持，校党委</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">班子</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">全体成员参加。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">会议牢牢把握民主生活会要求，深入学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">以</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“巩固深化党纪学习教育成果、综合发挥党的纪律教育约束和保障激励作用，为进一步全面深化改革、推进中国式现代化提供坚强纪律保证”为主题，紧密结合思想和工作实际进行自我检视、党性分析，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">围绕</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">202</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">4</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">年</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">以来的主要收获、存在问题、整改</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">措施</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">自我批评、</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">个人重大事项报告等内容，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px">进一步深化学习教育、统一思想认识、查摆存在问题、推动整改落实。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">会前，党委班子成员通过集体研讨、个人自学，集中深入学习党的二十大报告、党章以及习近平总书记在党的二十届</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">三</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">中全会上的重要讲话精神。会上，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">党委副书记、校长蒋明</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">首先通报了上年度</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">主题</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">教育专题民主生活会整改措施落实情况，以及本次民主生活会征求意见情况，代表学校领导班子作了对照检查，盘点收获的同时，阐述班子存在的问题并提出整改措施。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">在此基础上，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">党委班子成员根据存在问题认领工作责任，并逐一进行对照检查发言，开展批评与自我批评，并对批评意见作出表态。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">丁初效在听取检视报告后进行了点评。他以学校</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“总体导向公平公正”“各项成绩总体喜人”“校园总体安全稳定”三点充分肯定了党委班子一年来的各项工作。同时，他指出四点管理漏洞：一是以知促行有待深化，二是工作短板有待补好，三是深入群众有待提升，四是争先创优有待加强。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">商迪美</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">在听取学校领导班子检视报告和班子成员个人发言后，对本次民主生活会作了深刻点评。</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">她指出本次民主生活会会前意见征求充分，会上检视深刻，充分肯定了民主生活会的成效质量。同时她指出两点不足之处：一是检视材料结构有待完善；二是聚焦问题还要再深入，原因剖析要深挖。</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">对于学校党委班子未来的工作，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px">她希望校党委加强全面从严治党，坚决杜绝师德师风严重失范事件。</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/3/202503070819594734.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202503070819594734.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/3/202503070819599212.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202503070819599212.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/3/202503070819595211.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202503070819595211.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/3/202503070820018139.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202503070820018139.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/3/202503070820035126.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202503070820035126.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/3/202503070820033449.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202503070820033449.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/3/202503070820021729.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202503070820021729.JPG" /></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"></span>
</p><p>
</p>
    
